/www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2018/08/06/littelfuse-lfus-q2-2018-earnings-conference-call-t.aspx"},{"c":"LFUS 2018 Q2","e":"lfus","d":"2018-08-01","l":"pricing_power","r":"management","s":"Steven Fox","x":"You seem pretty comfortable with the idea of at least passing through these costs to customers.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2018/08/06/littelfuse-lfus-q2-2018-earnings-conference-call-t.aspx"},{"c":"LFUS 2018 Q2","e":"lfus","d":"2018-08-01","l":"pricing_power","r":"management","s":"Dave Heinzmann","x":"In many of those cases, it's necessary for us to pass that on.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2018/08/06/littelfuse-lfus-q2-2018-earnings-conference-call-t.aspx"},{"c":"LFUS 2018 Q2","e":"lfus","d":"2018-08-01","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Meenal Sethna","x":"Our industrial segment achieved a 16.2% operating margin for the quarter, as robust sales growth and prior cost-reduction efforts improved margins more than 900 basis points over last year.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2018/08/06/littelfuse-lfus-q2-2018-earnings-conference-call-t.aspx"},{"c":"LFUS 2018 Q2","e":"lfus","d":"2018-08-01","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Dave Heinzmann","x":"With these cost savings actions under way and others planned, we remain on track to realize a $30 million run-rate synergy target by the end of 2019.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2018/08/06/littelfuse-lfus-q2-2018-earnings-conference-call-t.aspx"},{"c":"LFUS 2018 Q3","e":"lfus","d":"2018-10-31","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Meenal Sethna","x":"It included $10 million in after-tax charges, mainly due to restructuring, purchase accounting and integration costs associated with the acquisition of IXYS.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2018/10/31/littelfuse-inc-lfus-q3-2018-earnings-conference-ca.aspx"},{"c":"LFUS 2018 Q4","e":"lfus","d":"2019-01-30","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Meenal Sethna","x":"During the fourth quarter, we took some cost-reduction actions within this business and expect profitability improvements in the upcoming quarter.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2019/01/30/littelfuse-lfus-q4-2018-earnings-conference-call-t.aspx"},{"c":"LFUS 2018 Q4","e":"lfus","d":"2019-01-30","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Meenal Sethna","x":"Recognizing the near-term challenging end market dynamics, we have implemented short-term cost containment measures beyond our typical cost-reduction initiatives across our businesses.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2019/01/30/littelfuse-lfus-q4-2018-earnings-conference-call-t.aspx"},{"c":"LFUS 2019 Q1","e":"lfus","d":"2019-05-01","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Meenal Anil Sethna","x":"GAAP EPS included $12 million in after-tax charges mainly due to nonoperating foreign exchange losses as well as acquisition, integration and restructuring charges.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2019/05/01/littelfuse-inc-lfus-q1-2019-earnings-call-transcri.aspx"},{"c":"LFUS 2019 Q1","e":"lfus","d":"2019-05-01","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Meenal Anil Sethna","x":"Within the sensor business, we followed fourth quarter cost reduction with additional action during the first quarter.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2019/05/01/littelfuse-inc-lfus-q1-2019-earnings-call-transcri.aspx"},{"c":"LFUS 2019 Q2","e":"lfus","d":"2019-07-31","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"David W. Heinzmann","x":"During these demand challenges, we are targeting a mid-teens operating margin balancing prudent cost savings in management, while continuing to invest for the long term.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2019/07/31/littelfuse-inc-lfus-q2-2019-earnings-call-transcri.aspx"},{"c":"LFUS 2019 Q2","e":"lfus","d":"2019-07-31","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Meenal A. Sethna","x":"We're also continuing our ongoing structural cost reduction projects which include IXYS synergy initiatives.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2019/07/31/littelfuse-inc-lfus-q2-2019-earnings-call-transcri.aspx"},{"c":"LFUS 2019 Q3","e":"lfus","d":"2019-10-30","l":"pricing_power","r":"management","s":"David W. Heinzmann","x":"And so what we're finding is it's a little more challenging to pass-through some of those cost impacts.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2019/10/31/littelfuse-inc-lfus-q3-2019-earnings-call-transcri.aspx"},{"c":"LFUS 2019 Q3","e":"lfus","d":"2019-10-30","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Meenal Anil Sethna","x":"These factors were partially offset by benefits from IXYS synergies and other cost reduction actions.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2019/10/31/littelfuse-inc-lfus-q3-2019-earnings-call-transcri.aspx"},{"c":"LFUS 2019 Q3","e":"lfus","d":"2019-10-30","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Meenal Anil Sethna","x":"During the quarter we continued our cost reduction efforts while also closing our automotive sensor factory in Italy.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2019/10/31/littelfuse-inc-lfus-q3-2019-earnings-call-transcri.aspx"},{"c":"LFUS 2019 Q4","e":"lfus","d":"2020-01-29","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Meenal A. Sethna","x":"We moderated the impact of topline decline with both cost restructuring and synergies from our IXYS acquisition across both gross margin and operating expenses.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2020/01/29/littelfuse-inc-lfus-q4-2019-earnings-call-transcri.aspx"},{"c":"LFUS 2019 Q4","e":"lfus","d":"2020-01-29","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Meenal A. Sethna","x":"We are seeing the benefits of the cost reduction activities we undertook in the past several quarters as margins continue to improve through the year.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2020/01/29/littelfuse-inc-lfus-q4-2019-earnings-call-transcri.aspx"},{"c":"LFUS 2020 Q1","e":"lfus","d":"2020-04-29","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Meenal A. Sethna","x":"Partially offsetting this was our cost reduction efforts, favorable foreign exchange and lower commodity prices, which collectively contributed $0.55 in EPS benefit.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2020/04/29/littelfuse-inc-lfus-q1-2020-earnings-call-transcri.aspx"},{"c":"LFUS 2020 Q1","e":"lfus","d":"2020-04-29","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Meenal A. Sethna","x":"Operating margins across all of our segments benefited from favorable foreign exchange as well as the cost reduction actions we took in the quarter.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2020/04/29/littelfuse-inc-lfus-q1-2020-earnings-call-transcri.aspx"},{"c":"LFUS 2020 Q1","e":"lfus","d":"2020-04-29","l":"guidance","r":"management","s":"Meenal A. Sethna","x":"Given the lack of market and operational clarity at this time, we are withdrawing our full year guidance we provided in January, and we're unable to provide specific second quarter guidance.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2020/04/29/littelfuse-inc-lfus-q1-2020-earnings-call-transcri.aspx"},{"c":"LFUS 2020 Q2","e":"lfus","d":"2020-07-29","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Meenal A. Sethna","x":"Margins were affected by the lower sales volumes, carrying costs during production disruptions and COVID-related costs, partially offset by the benefits from the cost reduction actions we've taken.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2020/07/29/littelfuse-inc-lfus-q2-2020-earnings-call-transcri.aspx"},{"c":"LFUS 2020 Q2","e":"lfus","d":"2020-07-29","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Matthew Sheerin","x":"And then, the second part of that in terms of your operating leverage on that lower volume, would you expect the traditional or typical detrimental margin or maybe better than that because of the opex reductions and other cost cutting?","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2020/07/29/littelfuse-inc-lfus-q2-2020-earnings-call-transcri.aspx"},{"c":"LFUS 2020 Q3","e":"lfus","d":"2020-10-28","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Meenal Anil Sethna","x":"Margins were up 380 basis points versus last year, a result of last year's rightsizing activities, cost management efforts and foreign exchange benefit.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2020/10/28/littelfuse-inc-lfus-q3-2020-earnings-call-transcri/"},{"c":"LFUS 2020 Q3","e":"lfus","d":"2020-10-28","l":"cost_cuts","r":"analyst","s":"Shawn Matthew Harrison","x":"That will flow into '21 that you're not seeing right now or any other kind of permanent fixed cost reduction actions that you've taken here in '20 that could maybe help some of the leverage in '21?","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2020/10/28/littelfuse-inc-lfus-q3-2020-earnings-call-transcri/"},{"c":"LFUS 2020 Q4","e":"lfus","d":"2021-02-03","l":"pricing_power","r":"management","s":"Luke Junk","x":"I'll pass it on.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2021/02/03/littelfuse-inc-lfus-q4-2020-earnings-call-transcri/"},{"c":"LFUS 2020 Q4","e":"lfus","d":"2021-02-03","l":"pricing_power","r":"management","s":"Karl Ackerman","x":"I guess we've heard several suppliers across the supply chain who have raised prices, particularly given shortages across foundry.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2021/02/03/littelfuse-inc-lfus-q4-2020-earnings-call-transcri/"},{"c":"LFUS 2021 Q1","e":"lfus","d":"2021-04-28","l":"pricing_power","r":"management","s":"Karl Ackerman","x":"And so I guess with many of your larger peers raising prices across the distribution channel and lead times extending, maybe instead of raising prices, are you able to sign longer-term volume agreements with your customers?","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2021/04/28/littelfuse-inc-lfus-q1-2021-earnings-call-transcri/"},{"c":"LFUS 2021 Q1","e":"lfus","d":"2021-04-28","l":"pricing_power","r":"management","s":"David Heinzmann","x":"Matt, on that through traditional customers in distribution, of course, we've passed through a couple of different price increases, which will begin to flow through.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2021/04/28/littelfuse-inc-lfus-q1-2021-earnings-call-transcri/"},{"c":"LFUS 2021 Q2","e":"lfus","d":"2021-07-28","l":"streaming","r":"management","s":"David Heinzmann","x":"With new cloud and video streaming services continuing to come on board a good source of design activity remains the data center applications where we secured key wins in the quarter in the U.S. Taiwan and Southeast Asia.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2021/07/28/littelfuse-inc-lfus-q2-2021-earnings-call-transcri/"},{"c":"LFUS 2021 Q2","e":"lfus","d":"2021-07-28","l":"pricing_power","r":"management","s":"Meenal A. Sethna","x":"Price realization has been quicker in areas where we are heavier in distribution like our electronics segment.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2021/07/28/littelfuse-inc-lfus-q2-2021-earnings-call-transcri/"},{"c":"LFUS 2021 Q2","e":"lfus","d":"2021-07-28","l":"pricing_power","r":"management","s":"Meenal A. Sethna","x":"Operating margins in this segment are most exposed to commodity price increases due to product composition and content with lower price realization offsets due to customer structure.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2021/07/28/littelfuse-inc-lfus-q2-2021-earnings-call-transcri/"},{"c":"LFUS 2021 Q3","e":"lfus","d":"2021-10-27","l":"pricing_power","r":"management","s":"Meenal A. Sethna","x":"Operating margins in the quarter were 28.9% our strong margins were a result of favorable regional and product mix at these robust volume levels, as well as benefits from price realization.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2021/10/27/littelfuse-inc-lfus-q3-2021-earnings-call-transcri/"},{"c":"LFUS 2021 Q3","e":"lfus","d":"2021-10-27","l":"pricing_power","r":"management","s":"Meenal A. Sethna","x":"And then I'd say, part of that last there is also price realization.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2021/10/27/littelfuse-inc-lfus-q3-2021-earnings-call-transcri/"},{"c":"LFUS 2021 Q3","e":"lfus","d":"2021-10-27","l":"cost_cuts","r":"analyst","s":"Christopher Glynn","x":"And how we might consider the -- either cost savings or productivity throughput impacts, as the timeline progresses?","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2021/10/27/littelfuse-inc-lfus-q3-2021-earnings-call-transcri/"},{"c":"LFUS 2025 Q3","e":"lfus","d":"2025-10-29","l":"tariffs","r":"management","s":"Abhishek Khandelwal","x":"Our transportation segment margins were negatively impacted by lower volume, higher stock and variable comp, and unfavorable tariff timing.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2025/10/30/littelfuse-lfus-q3-2025-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"LFUS 2025 Q3","e":"lfus","d":"2025-10-29","l":"tariffs","r":"management","s":"Abhishek Khandelwal","x":"So when I talk about the impact of tariff, what I am really talking about is if you kind of go back nine years and think about a 2Q call, we had some tariff timing in the quarter where we saw the benefit of where we saw the pricing, but the cost had not quite flushed with the P&L. That was about…","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2025/10/30/littelfuse-lfus-q3-2025-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"LFUS 2025 Q4","e":"lfus","d":"2026-01-28","l":"tariffs","r":"management","s":"Abhishek Khandelwal","x":"If you think about the price cost type to tariff, we did our teams did a great job managing that.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/01/28/littelfuse-lfus-q4-2025-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"LFUS 2025 Q4","e":"lfus","d":"2026-01-28","l":"pricing_power","r":"analyst","s":"Luke Junk","x"